{"seq":2,"slug":"jit-compilation","title":"JIT 编译","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/java-language/jvm-internals/jit-compilation","wordCount":980,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"jit-编译\">JIT 编译</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>JIT（Just-In-Time）编译是 JVM 将热点字节码在运行时编译为本地机器码的优化技术。Java 采用&quot;解释执行 + JIT 编译&quot;的混合模式——程序启动时解释执行字节码，当某段代码被频繁执行（达到热点阈值）后，JIT 编译器将其编译为优化的本地代码。这种设计兼顾了启动速度和峰值性能。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[.class 字节码] --&gt; B{解释器}&#10;    B --&gt; C[逐条执行]&#10;    B --&gt; D{热点检测}&#10;    D --&gt;|达到阈值| E[C1 编译器]&#10;    D --&gt;|高频热点| F[C2 编译器]&#10;    E --&gt; G[Level 1-3 优化代码]&#10;    F --&gt; H[Level 4 深度优化代码]&#10;    G --&gt; I[Code Cache]&#10;    H --&gt; I&#10;    I --&gt; J[直接执行机器码]\">graph LR\n    A[.class 字节码] --&gt; B{解释器}\n    B --&gt; C[逐条执行]\n    B --&gt; D{热点检测}\n    D --&gt;|达到阈值| E[C1 编译器]\n    D --&gt;|高频热点| F[C2 编译器]\n    E --&gt; G[Level 1-3 优化代码]\n    F --&gt; H[Level 4 深度优化代码]\n    G --&gt; I[Code Cache]\n    H --&gt; I\n    I --&gt; J[直接执行机器码]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>执行模式</th>\n<th>启动速度</th>\n<th>峰值性能</th>\n<th>内存开销</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>纯解释 (-Xint)</td>\n<td>最快</td>\n<td>最低</td>\n<td>最小</td>\n<td>脚本/短任务</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>C1 编译 (-client)</td>\n<td>快</td>\n<td>中等</td>\n<td>较小</td>\n<td>GUI 应用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>C2 编译 (-server)</td>\n<td>慢</td>\n<td>最高</td>\n<td>较大</td>\n<td>长期运行服务</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>分层编译 (默认)</td>\n<td>快</td>\n<td>最高</td>\n<td>中等</td>\n<td>通用推荐</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"分层编译体系\">分层编译体系</h2><p>Java 8+ 默认启用分层编译（Tiered Compilation），将编译过程分为 5 个级别，实现启动速度和峰值性能的最佳平衡：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"java\" data-code=\"// Level 0: 解释执行，收集基本 profiling 信息&#10;// Level 1: C1 编译，无 profiling（简单方法的终态）&#10;// Level 2: C1 编译，有限 profiling&#10;// Level 3: C1 编译，完整 profiling（大多数方法的中间态）&#10;// Level 4: C2 编译，深度优化（热点方法的终态）\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// Level 0: 解释执行，收集基本 profiling 信息</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// Level 1: C1 编译，无 profiling（简单方法的终态）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// Level 2: C1 编译，有限 profiling</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// Level 3: C1 编译，完整 profiling（大多数方法的中间态）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// Level 4: C2 编译，深度优化（热点方法的终态）</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>典型编译路径</strong>：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[Level 0 解释执行] --&gt; B[Level 3 C1+完整profiling]&#10;    B --&gt; C[Level 4 C2深度优化]&#10;    A --&gt; D[Level 1 C1简单编译]&#10;    A --&gt; E[Level 2 C1+有限profiling]&#10;    E --&gt; C\">graph TD\n    A[Level 0 解释执行] --&gt; B[Level 3 C1+完整profiling]\n    B --&gt; C[Level 4 C2深度优化]\n    A --&gt; D[Level 1 C1简单编译]\n    A --&gt; E[Level 2 C1+有限profiling]\n    E --&gt; C</pre><p><strong>热点检测</strong>使用基于计数器的方案——方法调用计数器和回边计数器（循环体内的跳转次数）。当两者之和超过阈值时触发编译：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"java\" data-code=\"// -XX:CompileThreshold=10000  (解释模式下的默认阈值)&#10;// 分层编译下由 JVM 动态调整阈值&#10;&#10;// 查看 JIT 编译日志&#10;// -XX:+PrintCompilation&#10;//   72   1     3   java.lang.String::hashCode (55 bytes)&#10;//   74   2     4   java.lang.String::hashCode (55 bytes)&#10;// 格式：时间戳 编译ID 级别 方法名 (字节码大小)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// -XX:CompileThreshold=10000  (解释模式下的默认阈值)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 分层编译下由 JVM 动态调整阈值</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 查看 JIT 编译日志</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// -XX:+PrintCompilation</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">//   72   1     3   java.lang.String::hashCode (55 bytes)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">//   74   2     4   java.lang.String::hashCode (55 bytes)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 格式：时间戳 编译ID 级别 方法名 (字节码大小)</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>级别</th>\n<th>编译器</th>\n<th>Profiling</th>\n<th>优化程度</th>\n<th>编译速度</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>0</td>\n<td>解释器</td>\n<td>基本</td>\n<td>无</td>\n<td>无需编译</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>C1</td>\n<td>无</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>最快</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>C1</td>\n<td>有限</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>快</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>C1</td>\n<td>完整</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>中</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>4</td>\n<td>C2</td>\n<td>基于 L3 数据</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>慢</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"关键优化技术\">关键优化技术</h2><p>C2 编译器执行多种激进优化，是 Java 能达到接近 C++ 性能的关键：</p>\n<p><strong>方法内联（Method Inlining）</strong>——将被调方法的代码直接嵌入调用点，消除方法调用开销，并为后续优化开辟空间：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"java\" data-code=\"// 优化前&#10;public int compute(int x) {&#10;    return square(x) + 1;&#10;}&#10;private int square(int n) { return n * n; }&#10;&#10;// 内联后&#10;public int compute(int x) {&#10;    return x * x + 1;&#10;}&#10;&#10;// 控制参数&#10;// -XX:MaxInlineSize=35         小方法直接内联&#10;// -XX:FreqInlineSize=325       热点方法内联上限&#10;// -XX:InlineSmallCode=2000     已编译代码的内联上限\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 优化前</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">public</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> int</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> compute</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">int</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> x) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> square</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(x) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">private</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> int</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> square</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">int</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> n) { </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> n </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> n; }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 内联后</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">public</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> int</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> compute</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">int</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> x) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> x </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> x </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 控制参数</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// -XX:MaxInlineSize=35         小方法直接内联</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// -XX:FreqInlineSize=325       热点方法内联上限</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// -XX:InlineSmallCode=2000     已编译代码的内联上限</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>逃逸分析（Escape Analysis）</strong>——判断对象的作用域是否逃逸出方法或线程，据此执行标量替换和栈上分配：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"java\" data-code=\"public int sumPoints() {&#10;    int total = 0;&#10;    for (int i = 0; i &lt; 1000; i++) {&#10;        Point p = new Point(i, i * 2);  // p 不会逃逸出循环&#10;        total += p.x() + p.y();&#10;    }&#10;    return total;&#10;}&#10;&#10;// 经逃逸分析 + 标量替换后等价于：&#10;public int sumPoints() {&#10;    int total = 0;&#10;    for (int i = 0; i &lt; 1000; i++) {&#10;        int x = i;&#10;        int y = i * 2;&#10;        total += x + y;&#10;    }&#10;    return total;&#10;}&#10;// 完全消除了 Point 对象的堆分配\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">public</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> int</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> sumPoints</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    int</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> total </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">int</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1000</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; i</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">++</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        Point p </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Point</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(i, i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);  </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// p 不会逃逸出循环</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        total </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> p.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">x</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> p.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">y</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> total;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 经逃逸分析 + 标量替换后等价于：</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">public</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> int</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> sumPoints</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    int</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> total </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">int</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1000</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; i</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">++</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        int</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> x </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> i;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        int</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> y </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        total </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> x </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> y;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> total;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6